WEBVTT

00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.060
Be still, and know that I am God.

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:07.013
Let distracting thoughts pass rather than chasing them.

00:00:07.013 --> 00:00:12.216
You do not have to solve every feeling or hurry toward a spiritual experience.

00:00:12.216 --> 00:00:15.224
Receive whatever stillness is available.

00:00:15.224 --> 00:00:19.202
Focus on the divine Father, approached through Jesus.

00:00:19.202 --> 00:00:24.086
Present your needs, your calling, and your daily practices to God.

00:00:24.086 --> 00:00:30.513
Tell Him what you hope for, what you fear, and what you are trying to do with the life He has given you.

00:00:30.513 --> 00:00:35.144
Bring what you believe God has called you to do or become into the light.

00:00:35.144 --> 00:00:38.843
Ask for clarity around your next faithful step.

00:00:38.843 --> 00:00:43.141
Receive wisdom, and do not confuse urgency with direction.

00:00:43.141 --> 00:00:46.348
A calling may take time to become clear.

00:00:46.348 --> 00:00:53.175
You can ask, listen, learn, and choose the next faithful act without pretending to see the whole road.

00:00:53.175 --> 00:00:54.931
Now listen.
